}", "readme_md": "# Northwind Health OCI Terraform Bundle

Deploys a complete HIPAA-compliant three-tier .NET member claims portal architecture in `us-chicago-1`:
- Public Flexible Load Balancer + WAF ingress
- Private web tier (2x VM.Standard.E5.Flex 2 OCPU/16GB)
- Private app tier (2x VM.Standard.E5.Flex 4 OCPU/32GB + 250GB Block Volume each)
- Private Oracle Base DB Service (4 OCPU HA, 500GB storage)
- Object Storage (100GB bucket)
- Vault + KMS, IAM policies/dynamic groups, Logging/Monitoring, NSGs, private subnets

## Prerequisites
- OCI CLI configured (`oci session authenticate --region us-chicago-1` or API keys in `~/.oci/config`)
- Terraform v1.5+
- Permissions: Manage all resources in compartment

## Usage
1. Create `terraform.tfvars`:
   ```
   compartment_id   = "ocid1.compartment.oc1..example"
   label_prefix     = "northwind-health"
   ssh_public_key   = "ssh-rsa AAAAB3NzaC1yc2E..."
   db_admin_pwd     = "SecureP@ssw0rd123!"
   admin_cidr       = "203.0.113.0/24"  # Your IP/24
   ad_index         = 0
   ```
2. Deploy:
   ```bash
   terraform init
   terraform plan
   terraform apply
   ```

## Outputs
- `load_balancer_public_ip`: Access portal here (configure HTTPS later)
- `web_private_ips`, `app_private_ips`: SSH/config app
- `db_scan_dns`: Connect as `db_scan_dns:1521/NORTHWIND`
- `object_storage_bucket`: Claims data storage

## Post-Deployment
1. SSH instances (port 22 open to `admin_cidr`): `ssh opc@private_ip`
2. Install .NET 8 SDK/runtime: `sudo dnf install dotnet-sdk-8.0`
3. Deploy app code, configure web->app (port 8080), app->DB
4. Health endpoint `/health` on web port 80
5. Enable HTTPS on LB (upload cert), tune WAF rules
6. Logging in Console > Logging > Log group
7. Monitor metrics/alarms in Console

## POC Validation (6 weeks)
- **Phase 1 (Wk1)**: Assess infra (availability, NSGs, HIPAA controls)
- **Phase 2 (Wk2-3)**: Build/test app deployment
- **Phase 3 (Wk4-6)**: Load test p95 <300ms, 99.9% uptime, RTO <60min
- Cost: Monitor for 30% reduction vs on-prem

## Security/HIPAA
- Private tiers/NSGs block unauthorized access
- Vault encrypts volumes/DB/bucket (add secrets)
- WAF protects ingress
- Logging enabled on LB

## Cleanup
```bash
terraform destroy
```

## Notes
- DB version 19c; change if needed
- App ports: web=80, app=8080, db=1521 (customize NSGs)
- Scale: Edit `count`/shape_config
- HTTPS: Add `oci_load_balancer_certificate` + SSL listener

Contact Oracle architect for POC support."}, "artifact_key": "generated/terraform/bundle"}

